---
title: Two ideas built on cache and compaction
---
flowchart LR
    subgraph handoff [Automatic handoff]
        direction LR
        A1["Reach threshold<br>a limit you choose"]:::check --> A2["Wait for break<br>a natural pause in work"]:::check
        A2 --> A3["Write summary<br>verified, failed, one next step"]:::main
        A3 --> A4["Clear conversation"]:::main
        A4 --> A5["Continue fresh<br>you decide what survives"]:::ok
    end

    subgraph warm [Keep the cache warm]
        direction LR
        W1["User steps away"]:::check --> W2["Send tiny request<br>shortly before cache expires"]:::main
        W2 --> W3["Read conversation from cache<br>timer resets, billed as read"]:::main
        W3 -->|"repeat while away"| W2
        W3 --> W4["User returns<br>next turn is a cache read"]:::ok
    end

    subgraph legend [Legend]
        direction LR
        k1["Trigger or wait"]:::check
        k2["Action"]:::main
        k3["Result"]:::ok
        k1 ~~~ k2 ~~~ k3
    end

    classDef ok fill:#d4edda,stroke:#2e7d32,color:#1b3d1f
    classDef check fill:#fff3cd,stroke:#b8860b,color:#4a3800
    classDef main fill:#e3f2fd,stroke:#1565c0,color:#0d2a4a
